From 845d862b9b30cbf4099778a008d9a7e56831a5a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: YeonGyu-Kim <code.yeon.gyu@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 16 May 2026 01:36:57 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 5280/5749] test(prompt-async-gate): replace setTimeout sleeps
 with deterministic sync

Test-discipline.md forbids setTimeout(resolve, N) and sleep(N) in test bodies. Replace the 3 microtask and expiry sleeps with explicit microtask yields and deterministic clock advancement, preserving the prompt gate invariants without real-time waits.

Closes BLOCKER-3

Ultraworked with [Sisyphus](https://github.com/code-yeongyu/oh-my-openagent)

Co-authored-by: Sisyphus <clio-agent@sisyphuslabs.ai>
---
 src/hooks/shared/prompt-async-gate.test.ts | 61 ++++++++++++----------
 1 file changed, 33 insertions(+), 28 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/hooks/shared/prompt-async-gate.test.ts b/src/hooks/shared/prompt-async-gate.test.ts
index c9062a85..7667f089 100644
--- a/src/hooks/shared/prompt-async-gate.test.ts
+++ b/src/hooks/shared/prompt-async-gate.test.ts
